      "model": "semantic — duplicate boxes merged (one route53, one ec2 fleet), the 3 drawn Envoys = one fleet node, container boxes that name a real service/artifact become nodes (osb, cfn, sovereign, packer) while pure groupings (Provisioning Task, Configuration) do not.",
